Description: rewrite the pinned suite's three <magic_enum.hpp>
 includes to <magic_enum/magic_enum.hpp>. The getdeps magic_enum
 0.9.7 install keeps every header under magic_enum/, with no
 top-level header.
Category: upstream-compat
Revisit-When: drop if the suite pin moves to an upstream commit
 carrying new-style includes.

diff --git a/public/introspection.cc b/public/introspection.cc
--- a/public/introspection.cc
+++ b/public/introspection.cc
@@ -42 +42 @@
-#include <magic_enum.hpp>
+#include <magic_enum/magic_enum.hpp>
diff --git a/public/verbs_helper_suite.cc b/public/verbs_helper_suite.cc
--- a/public/verbs_helper_suite.cc
+++ b/public/verbs_helper_suite.cc
@@ -38 +38 @@
-#include <magic_enum.hpp>
+#include <magic_enum/magic_enum.hpp>
diff --git a/public/verbs_util.cc b/public/verbs_util.cc
--- a/public/verbs_util.cc
+++ b/public/verbs_util.cc
@@ -42 +42 @@
-#include <magic_enum.hpp>
